{"id":"n72137-1-11","stage":1,"title":"축하 · 祝贺","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72137-1-11-1","ko":"제가 드디어 시험에 합격했습니다.","zh":"我终于通过考试了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험에","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합격했습니다.","meaning":"合格，及格，通过","explanation":"합격하다：合格，及格，通过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"합격하다","audio":"/audio/6611b17115450c864474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85306","senseId":"1","lemma":"합격하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"6611b17115450c86","term":"합격하다","zh":"合格，及格，通过","audio":"/audio/6611b17115450c864474.mp3","entryId":"85306","definition":"通过考试、检查、审查等。","pronunciation":["합껴카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4136e158e281650c44b3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72137-1-11-2","ko":"정말 잘됐군요! 진심으로 축하를 드립니다.","zh":"真是太好了！真心为您庆祝！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘됐군요!","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진심으로","meaning":"真心","explanation":"진심：真心；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"진심","audio":"/audio/431c5321873ba8ee94a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28997","senseId":"1","lemma":"진심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축하를","meaning":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","explanation":"축하：祝贺，庆贺，道贺；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"축하","audio":"/audio/02fbd137536a81840667.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72137","senseId":"1","lemma":"축하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드립니다.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"431c5321873ba8ee","term":"진심","zh":"真心","audio":"/audio/431c5321873ba8ee94a2.mp3","entryId":"28997","definition":"真实恳切的心。","pronunciation":["진심"]},{"id":"02fbd137536a8184","term":"축하","zh":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","audio":"/audio/02fbd137536a81840667.mp3","entryId":"72137","definition":"对于别人发生的好事开心地表示问候；或指那样的问候。","pronunciation":["추카"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7421f7e0410642a42f1f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72137","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.7401,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我终于通过考试了。","真是太好了！真心为您庆祝！","我口渴了，能给我一杯冰水吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我终于通过考试了。","真是太好了！真心为您庆祝！","我口渴了，能给我一杯冰水吗？"],"answer":1}]}
